  "contentHtml": "<p>면역 관련</p><p>학생질문 모음입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 지라의 역할은?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 림프액은 누가 순환시키는가?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 백혈구는 혈액에만 있는가? 림프액에는 없는가?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>4. 항원=혈액의 응집원, 항체=응집소인 이유?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11f68be467d15b5cd6e90fba15e46fa34546d920\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11f68be467d15b5cd6e90fba15e46fa34546d920\" data-origin-width=\"1038\" data-origin-height=\"167\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06e0b223e3ba9fbdd92cc55fae47065756dfb34e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06e0b223e3ba9fbdd92cc55fae47065756dfb34e\" data-origin-width=\"341\" data-origin-height=\"160\"></div><p>5. 어떻게 항원을 약독화 시키는가? (독성을 약화시키는가?)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>6. 예방접종을 2회 3회 추가 실시하면 우리 몸에서 일어나는 일은?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3a0c7b2c387dd3ca34853c2274e23e94baf9f2b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3a0c7b2c387dd3ca34853c2274e23e94baf9f2b\" data-origin-width=\"571\" data-origin-height=\"419\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>7. 비특이적 방어의 &#39;백혈구&#39;(식세포 작용)와&#160; 특이적 방어의 &#39;대식세포&#39;는 같은 것인가?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6727ac840e329b47bddd09cbe26a46f67002572\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"681\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6727ac840e329b47bddd09cbe26a46f67002572\" data-origin-width=\"1262\" data-origin-height=\"615\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/306df6d27dc0bcaa6377a5c88dd3524496701f9b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/306df6d27dc0bcaa6377a5c88dd3524496701f9b\" data-origin-width=\"1376\" data-origin-height=\"838\"></div><p>8. 알러지는 무엇인가?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>9. mRNA 백신이란 무엇이고 어떻게 만드나? : 아래의 보건소 안내문은 너무 어렵지 않나?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3197fffdcff6f8fb2a5c29601d05132be29ee97e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3197fffdcff6f8fb2a5c29601d05132be29ee97e\" data-origin-width=\"1227\" data-origin-height=\"691\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
